{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1771167755704,"sessionID":"ses_39e2d200bffenWVxn564xoSdlc","part":{"id":"prt_c61d32da6001V8okTpll5SzB90","sessionID":"ses_39e2d200bffenWVxn564xoSdlc","messageID":"msg_c61d319be001PrTTUMaGj6Folm","type":"tool","callID":"call_61e7b8a3ad074fe5964c7e47","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/specs/phase-management.md"},"output":"<path>/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/specs/phase-management.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>1: # Spec: Phase Management\n2: \n3: ## Overview\n4: State machine governing the three core game phases: PLANNING → RUNNING → FINISHED.\n5: \n6: ## Functional Requirements\n7: \n8: ### Phase Definitions\n9: \n10: #### PLANNING Phase\n11: - **Entry Condition**: Level initialization or restart\n12: - **Duration**: Unlimited (player controls when to start)\n13: - **Allowed Actions**: Place/remove cells using Flux\n14: - **START Button**: Visible and enabled when ≥1 cell placed\n15: - **Exit Condition**: Player clicks START button\n16: \n17: #### RUNNING Phase\n18: - **Entry Condition**: Countdown finishes (3, 2, 1...) after player clicked START\n19: - **Duration**: Fixed countdown timer (level-specific, starts at 45s base)\n20: - **Allowed Actions**: Cell placement using saved Flux (add-only)\n21: - **Simulation**: Game of Life rules execute automatically\n22: - **Exit Conditions**:\n23:    - Timer reaches 0 → FINISHED (score finalization)\n24:    - All cells die → FINISHED (score stops accumulating, level ends)\n25: \n26: #### FINISHED Phase\n27: - **Entry Condition**: Timer expires or all cells die\n28: - **Duration**: Brief pause before auto-advance (2.0s)\n29: - **Allowed Actions**: None (view-only)\n30: - **Outcome Display**: Show score, cells alive\n31: - **Exit Condition**: Auto-advance after 2.0s (fade transition to next level)\n32: - **Simulation**: Stops completely, no carryover to next level\n33: \n34: ### State Machine\n35: ```typescript\n36: type GamePhase = 'PLANNING' | 'RUNNING' | 'FINISHED';\n37: \n38: interface PhaseState {\n39:   current: GamePhase;\n40:   canTransition: boolean;\n41:   blockers: string[]; // Reasons why transition blocked\n42: }\n43: \n44: const transitions = {\n45:   'PLANNING': ['COUNTDOWN', 'RUNNING'],\n46:   'COUNTDOWN': ['RUNNING'],\n47:   'RUNNING': ['FINISHED'],\n48:   'FINISHED': ['PLANNING'] // Auto-triggered, circular to next level\n49: };\n50: ```\n51: \n52: ## UI/UX Requirements\n53: \n54: ### Phase Indicators\n55: - **PLANNING**:\n56:    - \"Place your cells\" text or icon\n57:    - START button prominent (enabled when ≥1 cell placed)\n58:    - Flux counter visible\n59: - **COUNTDOWN**:\n60:    - Large \"3... 2... 1...\" display\n61:    - No input accepted\n62:    - Simulation NOT running yet\n63: - **RUNNING**:\n64:    - Timer prominently displayed (countdown)\n65:    - \"Simulation Running\" indicator\n66:    - Score ticking up in real-time\n67:    - Flux counter visible (if any saved)\n68: - **FINISHED**:\n69:    - \"Time's Up\" or \"Level Complete\" message\n70:    - Final score display\n71:    - Brief stats (cells alive)\n72:    - Auto-advance countdown indicator\n73: \n74: ### Phase Transitions\n75: - **PLANNING → COUNTDOWN**:\n76:    - Player clicks START button\n77:    - Immediate transition to countdown\n78: - **COUNTDOWN → RUNNING**:\n79:    - \"3, 2, 1\" countdown completes\n80:    - Simulation starts immediately\n81:    - Sound effect: \"Simulation starting\"\n82: - **RUNNING → FINISHED**:\n83:    - Timer hits 0 OR all cells die\n84:    - Simulation stops immediately\n85:    - Sound effect: \"Level complete\" or timer expiration\n86: - **FINISHED → PLANNING** (next level):\n87:    - Fade out current screen (2.0s)\n88:    - Fade in new level (2.0s)\n89:    - Fresh grid, fresh Flux, no carryover\n90: \n91: ## Edge Cases\n92: \n93: 1. **Zero Cells at Start**: START button disabled until ≥1 cell placed\n94: 2. **All Cells Die Early**: Level ends immediately, score stops, advances to next level\n95: 3. **Browser Tab Switch**: Timer continues running when tab inactive\n96: 4. **Rapid Phase Switching**: Prevent clicking START multiple times rapidly\n97: 5. **Countdown Interrupted**: No input allowed during countdown phase\n98: 6. **Level Transition**: No simulation carryover between levels - fresh start each level\n99: \n100: ## Implementation Notes\n101: \n102: - Use React useReducer for phase state management\n103: - Add COUNTDOWN phase between PLANNING and RUNNING\n104: - Phase transitions should be guarded (can't skip phases)\n105: - Timer must use accurate timing (Date.now() or performance.now())\n106: - Simulation must NOT start until countdown completes\n107: - Level transition stops simulation completely - no carryover\n108: - Consider using a state machine library like XState if complexity grows\n109: - Log phase transitions for debugging\n110: \n\n(End of file - total 110 lines)\n</content>","title":"specs/phase-management.md","metadata":{"preview":"# Spec: Phase Management\n\n## Overview\nState machine governing the three core game phases: PLANNING → RUNNING → FINISHED.\n\n## Functional Requirements\n\n### Phase Definitions\n\n#### PLANNING Phase\n- **Entry Condition**: Level initialization or restart\n- **Duration**: Unlimited (player controls when to start)\n- **Allowed Actions**: Place/remove cells using Flux\n- **START Button**: Visible and enabled when ≥1 cell placed\n- **Exit Condition**: Player clicks START button\n\n#### RUNNING Phase\n- **Entry Condition**: Countdown finishes (3, 2, 1...) after player clicked START\n- **Duration**: Fixed countdown timer (level-specific, starts at 45s base)\n- **Allowed Actions**: Cell placement using saved Flux (add-only)","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"time":{"start":1771167755688,"end":1771167755702}}}}
